WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Floodwater from Typhoon Ondoy covers a residential street in Project 8, Quezon City.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Residents move through deep water beside homes and parked vehicles.

00:16.000 --> 00:23.000
The camera documents the scale of flooding along Hereford Street.
